# Topic ACLs.  OWNER: Part 1
# Plug usernames = appliance name (refrigerator, microwave, ...)

# Each plug may only write its own topics
pattern write home/+/%u/power
pattern write home/+/%u/status

user processor
topic read home/+/+/power
topic read home/+/+/status
topic write home/alerts

user monitor
topic read home/#
